# Show and Tell puts Satoru alone onto the battlefield: it was not cast, and "Satoru and/or" counts it with no other
# creature entering (CR 603.4, 603.6a), so it draws for itself. Bot1's hand is 3 Islands after Show and Tell, 4 with the draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Satoru, the Infiltrator
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: U)
Bot1.Choose(Satoru, the Infiltrator)
Bot2.Choose()
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Satoru, the Infiltrator.Power = 2
